text: |-
  4
  Drone Spy Plane N1098L
  Spy Plane N1098L @ Sept 10th. Designed to drop off/pick up drones.
  AXEL10. HADES Spy program.
  The Flight N1098L is designed to launch military drones.
  Normally flies at 41,000' altitude. Dropped to 203' altitude
  116 knots stall speed @ 9:16am MT 1-mile from UVU.
  Then looped back to 1-mile from UVU and 203' altitude @
  stall speed 25 minutes after assassination.
  1) Release Video Footage (Univ Camera & Witnesses)
  2) Gov publishes WHO was on N1098L Flight
  3) Were drones launched?
  4) Were Military Drones at UVU @ 12:23 MT?
  5) Who authorized flight?
  6) Who communicated with flight?
  7) If drones. Who watched video footage
  8) Was foreign intelligence in communication with (or wanted)
  N1098L flight on Sept 10th?
  9) Was some of N1098L flight crew associated with NSCC?
  NEXT,
  IT'LL DELIVER
  THE TRUTH!
  No claim is made that drone assassinated Charlie Kirk. Or that
  flight crew knew about assassination.
  @PolitickleAi
